examples.setup:
What does `f` return for `a = {3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6}`, `n = 8`? What is its running time?
```c
int f(int a[], int n) {
  int m = a[0], c = 1;
  for (int i = 1; i < n; i++)
    if (a[i] > m) { m = a[i]; c++; }
  return c;
}
```
